<file path="post-mortems/01-GOLDEN-EXAMPLE-DB-Saturation.md">
 1: # 🏆 Golden Example: DB Saturation (Experiment 2)
 2: 
 3: > **Mục đích:** Đây là "tiêu chuẩn vàng" để tham khảo khi viết post-mortem cho các experiments khác.
 4: > **Experiment:** [Exp 2: Database Saturation](../INCIDENT_SIMULATION_GUIDE.md#-experiment-2-database-saturation-high-latency)
 5: > **Tình huống giả định:** Flash sale scenario, traffic `browse_heavy` rate 20 req/s, DB table lock 90s
 6: 
 7: ---
 8: 
 9: ## 📋 Incident Log (Real-time)
10: 
11: **Start:** 2026-05-22 14:32 UTC  
12: **Alert(s):** HighLatencyP95 (Order Service), HighErrorRate, APIGatewayLatencyFastBurn  
13: **IC:** Me (solo engineer)
14: 
15: ### SEV Assessment (ghi trong 30s đầu)
16: - **Initial SEV:** SEV-2
17:   - Lý do:
18:     - Nhiều users bị ảnh hưởng (browse_heavy traffic = 20 req/s)
19:     - Feature chính (checkout/browsing) bị ảnh hưởng
20:     - Không có data loss
21:     - Không có security issue
22:     - Không có SLA contractual với customer
23: - **Escalation decision:** Không escalate ngay, sẽ escalate Team Lead nếu > 15 phút không resolve (theo Escalation Matrix)
24: 
25: ### Timeline
26: - [14:32] 🔔 Alert fired: HighLatencyP95 (Order Service) - critical
27: - [14:32] 👀 Ack alert, mở Incident Log, ghi Initial SEV-2
28: - [14:33] 🔍 Check Alerting Overview → 3 alerts firing: HighLatencyP95, HighErrorRate, LatencyFastBurn
29:   - Observation: Tất cả liên quan latency → likely cùng root cause
30: - [14:34] 🔍 Check Unified Overview
31:   - RPS: 45 req/s (bình thường)
32:   - Error Rate: 12% (cao, bình thường < 1%)
33:   - P95 Latency: 3.2s (bình thường 400ms) → tăng 8x
34: - [14:35] 🤔 Hypothesis #1: Traffic surge gây overload
35:   - Check: RPS vẫn 45 req/s → **REJECT** (không phải traffic issue)
36: - [14:36] 🔍 Check App Performance → Order Service section
37:   - P95: 3.1s (tăng từ 400ms baseline)
38:   - Payment Service P95: 200ms (bình thường)
39:   - Observation: Chỉ order-service chậm, payment OK → bottleneck trong order-service
40: - [14:37] 🤔 Hypothesis #2: Order service code bug hoặc resource issue
41: - [14:38] 🔍 Check Tracing → sort by duration descending
42:   - Longest trace: 3.2s total
43:   - Span breakdown:
44:     - `get_product_catalog`: 2.8s (87% tổng thời gian) ← BOTTLENECK
45:     - `validate_input`: 15ms
46:     - `insert_order`: 180ms
47:     - `request_payment`: 200ms
48: - [14:39] 🤔 Hypothesis refined: `get_product_catalog` span chậm → likely DB hoặc cache issue
49: - [14:40] 🔍 Check DB Performance dashboard
50:   - Connection pool: 10/10 (đầy, bình thường 2-3/10)
51:   - Avg query duration: 2.5s (bình thường 5ms) → tăng 500x
52:   - Active queries: 38 queries đang chạy, tất cả SELECT trên `products` table
53: - [14:41] 🤔 Hypothesis confirmed: DB saturated, connection pool exhausted
54: - [14:42] 🔍 Check Cache Performance
55:   - Hit rate: 0% (bình thường 85%)
56:   - Observation: Cache miss → tất cả requests phải query DB → pool đầy
57: - [14:43] 🎯 Decision: Kill long-running queries trong PostgreSQL
58:   - **Reason:** Stop the bleeding ngay, investigate root cause sau
59:   - **Considered alternatives:**
60:     - Restart order-service: Không fix root cause (DB vẫn locked)
61:     - Increase connection pool: Cần restart service, mất thời gian
62:     - Wait for lock release: Không biết khi nào release, users đang chịu impact
63:   - **Risk:** Có thể kill legitimate queries, nhưng accept được vì đang incident
64: - [14:44] ⚡ Executed:
65:   ```bash
66:   docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
67:     SELECT pg_terminate_backend(pid) FROM pg_stat_activity
68:     WHERE state = 'active' AND query LIKE '%pg_sleep%';
69:   "
</file>

