<file path="ARCHITECTURE.md">
  1: # 🏗️ Observability Lab — Architecture
  2: 
  3: > E-commerce microservices platform with event-driven architecture, full observability stack, and Kafka event streaming.
  4: 
  5: ---
  6: 
  7: ## System Architecture
  8: 
  9: ```mermaid
 10: graph TB
 11: 
 12: subgraph Applications_VM_60GB_RAM
 13:     UI["Web UI (nginx :8580)"]
 14:     GW["API Gateway (Flask :5000)"]
 15:     OS["Order Service (Flask :5001)"]
 16:     PS["Payment Service (Flask :5002)"]
 17:     TG["Traffic Generator (:5003)"]
 18:     NW["Notification Worker (:5004)"]
 19:     IW["Inventory Worker (:5005)"]
 20:     PG["PostgreSQL 16"]
 21:     RD["Redis 7"]
 22:     KF["Kafka 3.7 KRaft"]
 23:     KE["Kafka Exporter"]
 24:     KUI["Kafka UI :8585"]
 25: end
 26: 
 27: subgraph Observability_VM_32GB_RAM
 28:     OTEL["OTel Collector"]
 29:     PROM["Prometheus"]
 30:     GRAF["Grafana"]
 31:     TEMPO["Tempo"]
 32:     LOKI["Loki"]
 33:     AM["Alertmanager"]
 34:     BB["Blackbox Exporter"]
 35: end
 36: 
 37: UI -->|reverse proxy| GW
 38: GW -->|HTTP| OS
 39: OS -->|HTTP| PS
 40: 
 41: OS -->|SQL| PG
 42: OS -->|cache| RD
 43: OS -->|"produce: order.created, stock.depleted"| KF
