  59: # Part 1: PostgreSQL Deep Dive
  60: 
  61: > **VM:** applications-vm
  62: > **Access:** `docker exec -it postgres psql -U app -d orders`
  63: > **Tables:** `orders`, `products`
  64: > **Pool:** `SimpleConnectionPool(minconn=1, maxconn=10)` trong order-service
  65: 
  66: ## 🔧 PG-1: Connection Pool Internals
  67: 
  68: **Kiến thức:** Hiểu connection lifecycle, connection states, và cách pool hoạt động.
  69: **Độ khó:** ⭐
  70: 
  71: ### Break
  72: ```bash
  73: # Xem connections hiện tại
  74: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
  75:   SELECT pid, state, query, client_addr, backend_start, state_change
  76:   FROM pg_stat_activity
  77:   WHERE datname = 'orders' AND usename = 'app';
  78: "
  79: 
  80: # Kill tất cả connections (giả lập network blip)
  81: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
  82:   SELECT pg_terminate_backend(pid)
  83:   FROM pg_stat_activity
  84:   WHERE datname = 'orders' AND usename = 'app' AND pid <> pg_backend_pid();
  85: "
  86: ```
  87: 
  88: ### Test (inspect internals)
  89: 
  90: Ngay sau khi kill, chạy traffic nhẹ rồi quan sát:
  91: ```bash
  92: # Chạy traffic để force reconnect
  93: curl -X POST http://localhost:5003/start \
  94:   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  95:   -d '{"scenario": "normal", "rate": 2, "duration": 30}'
  96: 
  97: # Xem connections tái tạo
  98: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
  99:   SELECT pid, state, query_start, state_change,
 100:          age(clock_timestamp(), backend_start) AS connection_age
 101:   FROM pg_stat_activity
 102:   WHERE datname = 'orders' AND usename = 'app';
 103: "
 104: ```
 105: 
 106: **Đọc output:**
 107: | Column | Ý nghĩa |
 108: |--------|---------|
 109: | `state` | `active` = đang query, `idle` = chờ trong pool, `idle in transaction` = transaction chưa commit |
 110: | `connection_age` | Connection mới tạo sẽ có age rất nhỏ (vài giây) |
 111: | `query_start` | Thời điểm query cuối bắt đầu |
 112: 
 113: ```bash
 114: # Đếm connections theo state
 115: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 116:   SELECT state, count(*)
 117:   FROM pg_stat_activity
 118:   WHERE datname = 'orders' AND usename = 'app'
 119:   GROUP BY state;
 120: "
 121: ```
 122: 
 123: ### Recovery
 124: Order-service sử dụng `SimpleConnectionPool` — pool tự tạo connection mới khi cần. Verify:
 125: ```bash
 126: # Chờ 10-20s sau khi traffic chạy, connections sẽ được recreate
 127: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 128:   SELECT count(*) AS total_connections
 129:   FROM pg_stat_activity
 130:   WHERE datname = 'orders' AND usename = 'app';
 131: "
 132: # Kỳ vọng: 1-3 connections (idle in pool)
 133: ```
 134: 
 135: ### 🎯 Câu hỏi kiểm tra
 136: - [ ] **Connection states:** `idle` vs `active` vs `idle in transaction` khác nhau thế nào? State nào nguy hiểm nếu kéo dài? (idle in transaction → giữ lock)
 137: - [ ] **Pool behavior:** Sau khi kill tất cả connections, order-service có crash không? Nó recover thế nào? (pool tạo connection mới khi `getconn()` được gọi)
 138: - [ ] **Production:** `max_connections` mặc định của PostgreSQL là bao nhiêu? Nếu có 5 services mỗi service pool max=10, tổng cần bao nhiêu connections? Có vượt default không?
 139: 
 140: ---
 141: 
 142: ## 🔧 PG-2: Dead Tuples & VACUUM
 143: 
 144: **Kiến thức:** Hiểu MVCC, dead tuples, table bloat, và tại sao VACUUM quan trọng.
 145: **Độ khó:** ⭐⭐
 146: 
 147: ### Break
 148: ```bash
 149: # Tạo 5000 rows rồi delete hết → tạo dead tuples
 150: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 151:   INSERT INTO orders (order_id, product_id, product_name, quantity, total_amount, status)
 152:   SELECT
 153:     'BT' || lpad(i::text, 6, '0'),
 154:     (i % 5) + 1,
 155:     'BTR Product ' || i,
 156:     1,
 157:     99.99,
 158:     'test'
 159:   FROM generate_series(1, 5000) AS i;
 160: "
 161: 
 162: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 163:   DELETE FROM orders WHERE status = 'test';
 164: "
 165: ```
 166: 
 167: ### Test (inspect internals)
 168: ```bash
 169: # Kiểm tra dead tuples
 170: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 171:   SELECT relname, n_live_tup, n_dead_tup,
 172:          CASE WHEN n_live_tup > 0
 173:               THEN round(n_dead_tup::numeric / n_live_tup * 100, 1)
 174:               ELSE 0 END AS dead_pct,
 175:          last_vacuum, last_autovacuum,
 176:          pg_size_pretty(pg_total_relation_size(relid)) AS total_size
 177:   FROM pg_stat_user_tables
 178:   WHERE relname IN ('orders', 'products');
 179: "
 180: ```
 181: 
 182: **Đọc output:**
 183: | Column | Ý nghĩa |
 184: |--------|---------|
 185: | `n_dead_tup` | Rows đã delete nhưng chưa được dọn → vẫn chiếm disk |
 186: | `dead_pct` | % dead tuples so với live → > 20% là cần VACUUM |
 187: | `last_autovacuum` | Lần cuối autovacuum chạy → NULL nếu chưa bao giờ |
 188: | `total_size` | Size bao gồm cả dead tuples (bloat) |
 189: 
 190: ```bash
 191: # Xem table size chi tiết (trước vacuum)
 192: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 193:   SELECT pg_size_pretty(pg_relation_size('orders')) AS table_size,
 194:          pg_size_pretty(pg_indexes_size('orders')) AS index_size,
 195:          pg_size_pretty(pg_total_relation_size('orders')) AS total_size;
 196: "
 197: ```
 198: 
 199: ### Recovery
 200: ```bash
 201: # Chạy VACUUM VERBOSE để dọn dead tuples
 202: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "VACUUM VERBOSE orders;"
 203: 
 204: # Verify dead tuples đã giảm
 205: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 206:   SELECT relname, n_live_tup, n_dead_tup, last_vacuum
 207:   FROM pg_stat_user_tables WHERE relname = 'orders';
 208: "
 209: # Kỳ vọng: n_dead_tup ≈ 0, last_vacuum = vừa chạy
 210: 
 211: # VACUUM FULL để reclaim disk space (cần exclusive lock!)
 212: # Chỉ chạy khi bloat lớn và có maintenance window
 213: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "VACUUM FULL orders;"
 214: ```
 215: 
 216: ### 🎯 Câu hỏi kiểm tra
 217: - [ ] **MVCC:** Tại sao DELETE không xóa row ngay? (vì transactions khác có thể đang đọc row đó — MVCC giữ old version)
 218: - [ ] **VACUUM vs VACUUM FULL:** VACUUM chỉ mark dead tuples as reusable. VACUUM FULL thực sự reclaim disk nhưng cần exclusive lock. Khi nào dùng cái nào?
 219: - [ ] **Autovacuum:** Autovacuum trigger khi nào? (`autovacuum_vacuum_threshold` + `autovacuum_vacuum_scale_factor` × `n_live_tup`). Với bảng 1M rows, dead tuples cần bao nhiêu mới trigger?
 220: - [ ] **Production:** Bảng `orders` tăng 100K rows/ngày, delete sau 90 ngày. Ước tính dead tuples nếu autovacuum bị disable?
 221: 
 222: ---
 223: 
 224: ## 🔧 PG-3: WAL & Checkpoint
 225: 
 226: **Kiến thức:** Hiểu Write-Ahead Log, checkpoint cycle, và tại sao WAL quan trọng cho durability.
 227: **Độ khó:** ⭐⭐⭐
 228: 
 229: ### Break
 230: ```bash
 231: # Tạo write load để generate WAL
 232: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 233:   INSERT INTO orders (order_id, product_id, product_name, quantity, total_amount, status)
 234:   SELECT
 235:     'WL' || lpad(i::text, 6, '0'),
 236:     (i % 5) + 1,
 237:     'WAL Test ' || i,
 238:     1,
 239:     49.99,
 240:     'wal_test'
 241:   FROM generate_series(1, 10000) AS i;
 242: "
 243: ```
 244: 
 245: ### Test (inspect internals)
 246: ```bash
 247: # Xem WAL statistics
 248: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "SELECT * FROM pg_stat_wal;"
 249: 
 250: # Xem WAL directory size
 251: docker exec postgres bash -c "du -sh /var/lib/postgresql/data/pg_wal/"
 252: 
 253: # List WAL files
 254: docker exec postgres bash -c "ls -la /var/lib/postgresql/data/pg_wal/ | head -20"
 255: 
 256: # Xem checkpoint statistics
 257: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "SELECT * FROM pg_stat_bgwriter;"
 258: ```
 259: 
 260: **Đọc output:**
 261: | Metric | Ý nghĩa |
 262: |--------|---------|
 263: | `wal_records` | Tổng WAL records đã ghi |
 264: | `wal_bytes` | Tổng bytes WAL |
 265: | `checkpoints_timed` | Checkpoints theo schedule (bình thường) |
 266: | `checkpoints_req` | Checkpoints do WAL đầy (không tốt nếu nhiều) |
 267: 
 268: ```bash
 269: # Xem current WAL position
 270: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "SELECT pg_current_wal_lsn(), pg_walfile_name(pg_current_wal_lsn());"
 271: 
 272: # Force một checkpoint
 273: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "CHECKPOINT;"
 274: 
 275: # So sánh checkpoints_timed vs checkpoints_req sau checkpoint
 276: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 277:   SELECT checkpoints_timed, checkpoints_req,
 278:          pg_size_pretty(buffers_checkpoint * 8192::bigint) AS checkpoint_data
 279:   FROM pg_stat_bgwriter;
 280: "
 281: ```
 282: 
 283: ### Recovery
 284: ```bash
 285: # Cleanup test data
 286: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "DELETE FROM orders WHERE status = 'wal_test';"
 287: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "VACUUM orders;"
 288: ```
 289: 
 290: ### 🎯 Câu hỏi kiểm tra
 291: - [ ] **WAL purpose:** Tại sao cần ghi WAL trước khi ghi data file? (crash recovery — replay WAL để recover uncommitted changes)
 292: - [ ] **Checkpoint:** Checkpoint làm gì? (flush dirty pages từ shared buffers ra disk, advance WAL recycle point). Tại sao checkpoint quá thường xuyên ảnh hưởng performance?
 293: - [ ] **Production:** `max_wal_size` = 1GB (default). Nếu write load quá cao → WAL đầy trước checkpoint → forced checkpoint. Dấu hiệu trên `pg_stat_bgwriter`?
