 354: ## 🔧 PG-5: Lock Monitoring
 355: 
 356: **Kiến thức:** Lock types, lock conflicts, deadlock detection.
 357: **Độ khó:** ⭐⭐⭐
 358: 
 359: > ⚠️ **LONG-RUNNING LOCK:** Transaction A giữ lock 60 giây.
 360: > Nếu có traffic đang chạy, requests sẽ timeout hoặc fail.
 361: > **Production rule:** Luôn set `statement_timeout` để tránh lock vô hạn.
 362: > ```sql
 363: > SET statement_timeout = '30s';  -- Auto-kill query sau 30s
 364: > ```
 365: 
 366: ### Break
 367: ```bash
 368: # Terminal 1: Transaction A — lock row
 369: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 370:   BEGIN;
 371:   UPDATE products SET stock = stock - 1 WHERE id = 1;
 372:   SELECT pg_sleep(60);
 373:   COMMIT;
 374: " &
 375: 
 376: # Chờ 2s để transaction A bắt đầu
 377: sleep 2
 378: 
 379: # Terminal 2: Transaction B — cố update cùng row → bị block
 380: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 381:   UPDATE products SET stock = stock + 1 WHERE id = 1;
 382: "
 383: # Command này sẽ bị HANG cho đến khi Transaction A commit/rollback
 384: ```
 385: 
 386: ### Test (inspect internals)
 387: Mở terminal mới trong khi 2 transactions đang chạy:
 388: ```bash
 389: # Xem locks hiện tại
 390: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 391:   SELECT pid, locktype, relation::regclass, mode, granted, waitstart
 392:   FROM pg_locks
 393:   WHERE relation = 'products'::regclass;
 394: "
 395: 
 396: # Xem ai đang block ai
 397: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 398:   SELECT
 399:     blocked.pid AS blocked_pid,
 400:     blocked.query AS blocked_query,
 401:     blocking.pid AS blocking_pid,
 402:     blocking.query AS blocking_query
 403:   FROM pg_stat_activity blocked
 404:   JOIN pg_locks bl ON blocked.pid = bl.pid AND NOT bl.granted
 405:   JOIN pg_locks gl ON bl.relation = gl.relation AND bl.locktype = gl.locktype AND gl.granted
 406:   JOIN pg_stat_activity blocking ON gl.pid = blocking.pid
 407:   WHERE blocked.pid <> blocking.pid;
 408: "
 409: 
 410: # Hoặc dùng built-in function
 411: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 412:   SELECT pid, pg_blocking_pids(pid) AS blocked_by, query
 413:   FROM pg_stat_activity
 414:   WHERE cardinality(pg_blocking_pids(pid)) > 0;
 415: "
 416: ```
 417: 
 418: **Đọc output:**
 419: | Column | Ý nghĩa |
 420: |--------|---------|
 421: | `granted = false` | Lock đang chờ (bị block) |
 422: | `mode` | `RowExclusiveLock` (UPDATE), `AccessExclusiveLock` (ALTER TABLE, LOCK TABLE) |
 423: | `pg_blocking_pids()` | PIDs đang block process này |
 424: 
 425: ### Recovery
 426: ```bash
 427: # Kill blocking transaction (Transaction A)
 428: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "
 429:   SELECT pg_terminate_backend(pid)
 430:   FROM pg_stat_activity
 431:   WHERE state = 'active' AND query LIKE '%pg_sleep%';
 432: "
 433: # Transaction B sẽ tự unblock và complete
 434: 
 435: # Verify stock đúng
 436: docker exec postgres psql -U app -d orders -c "SELECT id, name, stock FROM products WHERE id = 1;"
 437: ```
 438: 
 439: ### 🎯 Câu hỏi kiểm tra
 440: - [ ] **Lock types:** `RowExclusiveLock` vs `AccessExclusiveLock` — cái nào block reads? (AccessExclusive block tất cả, RowExclusive chỉ block concurrent writes trên cùng row)
 441: - [ ] **Deadlock:** Nếu Transaction A lock row 1 rồi cố lock row 2, Transaction B lock row 2 rồi cố lock row 1 → gì xảy ra? (PostgreSQL detect deadlock sau `deadlock_timeout`, kill 1 transaction)
 442: - [ ] **Production:** Query chạy 30 phút giữ lock → bạn kill nó hay chờ? Cách tìm long-running queries? (`SELECT pid, age(clock_timestamp(), query_start), query FROM pg_stat_activity WHERE state = 'active'`)
