 796: ## 🔧 RD-1: Memory & Eviction
 797: 
 798: **Kiến thức:** maxmemory policy, eviction algorithms, memory management.
 799: **Độ khó:** ⭐⭐
 800: 
 801: ### Break
 802: ```bash
 803: # Xem memory hiện tại
 804: docker exec redis redis-cli INFO memory | grep -E "used_memory_human|maxmemory_human|maxmemory_policy"
 805: 
 806: # Set maxmemory rất thấp
 807: docker exec redis redis-cli CONFIG SET maxmemory 1mb
 808: 
 809: # Fill memory với dummy keys
 810: for i in $(seq 1 5000); do
 811:   docker exec redis redis-cli SET "dummy:$i" "$(head -c 200 /dev/urandom | base64)" EX 300 > /dev/null
 812: done
 813: ```
 814: 
 815: ### Test (inspect internals)
 816: ```bash
 817: # Xem memory sau khi fill
 818: docker exec redis redis-cli INFO memory | grep -E "used_memory_human|maxmemory|evicted_keys"
 819: 
 820: # Xem eviction policy
 821: docker exec redis redis-cli CONFIG GET maxmemory-policy
 822: 
 823: # Kiểm tra key count
 824: docker exec redis redis-cli DBSIZE
 825: 
 826: # Xem product catalog cache bị evict chưa
 827: docker exec redis redis-cli EXISTS "product:catalog"
 828: ```
 829: 
 830: **Eviction policies:**
 831: | Policy | Ý nghĩa |
 832: |--------|---------|
 833: | `noeviction` | Trả error khi memory đầy (default) |
 834: | `allkeys-lru` | Evict least recently used key (phổ biến nhất) |
 835: | `volatile-lru` | Evict LRU key có TTL |
 836: | `allkeys-random` | Random evict |
 837: 
 838: > ⚠️ **FLUSHALL xóa TẤT CẢ data trong Redis**, bao gồm cả `product:catalog` cache.
 839: > Sau khi chạy FLUSHALL, app sẽ có cache-miss storm → P95 tăng tạm thời.
 840: > Đây là expected behavior — cache sẽ tự warm lại khi có traffic.
 841: 
 842: ### Recovery
 843: ```bash
 844: # Xóa dummy keys
 845: docker exec redis redis-cli KEYS "dummy:*" | head -100
 846: docker exec redis redis-cli --scan --pattern "dummy:*" | xargs docker exec -i redis redis-cli DEL
 847: 
 848: # Hoặc FLUSHALL (xóa tất cả)
 849: docker exec redis redis-cli FLUSHALL
 850: 
 851: # Restore maxmemory
 852: docker exec redis redis-cli CONFIG SET maxmemory 0
 853: # 0 = unlimited (dùng hết RAM available)
 854: 
 855: # Verify
 856: docker exec redis redis-cli INFO memory | grep -E "used_memory_human|evicted_keys"
 857: ```
 858: 
 859: ### 🎯 Câu hỏi kiểm tra
 860: - [ ] **Eviction impact:** Nếu `product:catalog` bị evict → next request phải query DB → P95 tăng. Đây là cache-miss storm giống Experiment 11 trong IS guide.
 861: - [ ] **Policy choice:** Production cache server nên dùng policy nào? (`allkeys-lru` — auto evict least used, tránh OOM)
 862: - [ ] **Production:** Redis 4GB maxmemory, key trung bình 1KB. Tối đa bao nhiêu keys? (~4M, nhưng thực tế ít hơn do Redis overhead per key ~100 bytes)
