 975: ## 🔧 RD-4: Slowlog
 976: 
 977: **Kiến thức:** Redis single-threaded model, O(N) commands, pipeline optimization.
 978: **Độ khó:** ⭐⭐
 979: 
 980: ### Break
 981: ```bash
 982: # Tạo nhiều keys
 983: for i in $(seq 1 3000); do
 984:   docker exec redis redis-cli SET "slow:$i" "value$i" > /dev/null
 985: done
 986: 
 987: # Chạy O(N) command — KEYS * sẽ scan tất cả keys
 988: docker exec redis redis-cli KEYS "*"
 989: 
 990: # Set slowlog threshold thấp để bắt được
 991: docker exec redis redis-cli CONFIG SET slowlog-log-slower-than 1000
 992: # 1000 microseconds = 1ms
 993: ```
 994: 
 995: ### Test (inspect internals)
 996: ```bash
 997: # Xem slowlog
 998: docker exec redis redis-cli SLOWLOG GET 10
 999: 
1000: # Đọc: ID, timestamp, duration (microseconds), command
1001: docker exec redis redis-cli SLOWLOG LEN
1002: ```
1003: 
1004: **Đọc output:**
1005: ```
1006: 1) 1) (integer) 0          # ID
1007:    2) (integer) 1716123456 # Timestamp
1008:    3) (integer) 15234      # Duration: 15ms — SLOW!
1009:    4) 1) "KEYS"            # Command
1010:       2) "*"
1011: ```
1012: 
1013: ### Recovery
1014: ```bash
1015: # Cleanup
1016: docker exec redis redis-cli --scan --pattern "slow:*" | xargs docker exec -i redis redis-cli DEL
1017: 
1018: # Reset slowlog threshold
1019: docker exec redis redis-cli CONFIG SET slowlog-log-slower-than 10000
1020: 
1021: # Clear slowlog
1022: docker exec redis redis-cli SLOWLOG RESET
1023: ```
1024: 
1025: ### 🎯 Câu hỏi kiểm tra
1026: - [ ] **Single threaded:** Redis single-threaded. `KEYS *` mất 15ms = TẤT CẢ clients bị block 15ms. Với 1000 req/s, bao nhiêu requests bị ảnh hưởng?
1027: - [ ] **Alternatives:** Thay `KEYS *` bằng gì? (`SCAN` — iterative, non-blocking). Thay `SORT` bằng gì? (sort ở application layer)
1028: - [ ] **Production:** Slowlog thấy command `HGETALL` mất 50ms trên hash có 100K fields. Giải pháp? (chia nhỏ hash, hoặc dùng `HSCAN`)
