1066: ```
1067: 
1068: **Storage structure:**
1069: ```
1070: /prometheus/
1071: ├── wal/           ← Write-Ahead Log (uncommitted data)
1072: ├── chunks_head/   ← Current head block (in-memory + mmap)
1073: ├── 01HXYZ.../     ← Compacted block (2h of data)
1074: │   ├── chunks/    ← Compressed time series data
1075: │   ├── index      ← Inverted index (label → series)
1076: │   └── meta.json  ← Block metadata
1077: └── lock           ← Process lock file
1078: ```
1079: 
1080: ### Recovery
1081: ```bash
1082: # Verify Prometheus healthy
1083: curl -s http://localhost:9090/-/healthy
1084: # Kỳ vọng: Prometheus Server is Healthy.
1085: 
1086: # Verify metrics không bị gap lớn (có thể mất 1-2 scrape intervals)
1087: # Mở Grafana → prometheus-self dashboard → check uptime
1088: ```
1089: 
1090: ### 🎯 Câu hỏi kiểm tra
1091: - [ ] **WAL replay:** Prometheus crash → restart → replay WAL. Mất data trong bao lâu? (tối đa 2 phút — dữ liệu trong head block chưa persist)
1092: - [ ] **Block lifecycle:** Head block → compacted block sau bao lâu? (2 giờ default `--storage.tsdb.min-block-duration`)
1093: - [ ] **Production:** Prometheus OOM killed → restart → WAL replay mất 10 phút (WAL quá lớn). Cách giảm WAL size? (giảm scrape interval, giảm cardinality)
