   1: # 📐 Kế Hoạch Mở Rộng Ứng Dụng
   2: 
   3: > Đề xuất mở rộng hệ thống e-commerce từ 6 services lên 10 services, tập trung vào **architectural diversity** để maximize kiến thức DevOps/SRE/Platform khi deploy lên AWS.
   4: 
   5: ---
   6: 
   7: ## Mục Tiêu
   8: 
   9: | # | Mục tiêu | Đo lường |
  10: |---|---------|---------|
  11: | 1 | Tăng **architectural diversity** | Thêm ≥ 3 communication patterns mới |
  12: | 2 | Tạo **failure scenarios phức tạp hơn** | Cascading failures qua ≥ 4 services |
  13: | 3 | Học thêm **design patterns production-grade** | Saga, CQRS, Circuit Breaker |
  14: | 4 | Giữ chi phí AWS hợp lý | Không tăng quá 40% so với hiện tại |
  15: 
  16: ---
  17: 
  18: ## Hiện Trạng (6 Services)
  19: 
  20: ```
  21: Web UI → API Gateway → Order Service → Payment Service
  22:                               ↕                ↕
  23:                          PostgreSQL          Redis
  24:                               ↕
  25:                            Kafka
  26:                          ↙      ↘
  27:             Notification Worker  Inventory Worker
  28: ```
  29: 
  30: **Patterns đã có:**
  31: - ✅ Sync HTTP (request-response)
  32: - ✅ Async Event-driven (Kafka pub/sub)
  33: - ✅ Cache-Aside (Redis)
  34: - ✅ BFF (API Gateway)
  35: - ✅ Idempotent Processing (processed_events table)
  36: - ✅ Pessimistic Locking (SELECT FOR UPDATE)
  37: - ✅ Distributed Trace Propagation (W3C traceparent qua Kafka headers)
  38: 
  39: **Thiếu:**
  40: - ❌ Saga pattern (distributed transaction)
  41: - ❌ Circuit Breaker (failure isolation)
  42: - ❌ CQRS/Data sync (read model khác write model)
  43: - ❌ Authentication/Authorization (JWT propagation)
  44: - ❌ Health check endpoint chuẩn (liveness/readiness)
  45: - ❌ Rate limiting
  46: - ❌ Structured error response chuẩn (RFC 7807)
  47: - ❌ TLS termination (HTTPS)
  48: - ❌ Secrets management (JWT keys, DB passwords)
  49: - ❌ Network segmentation (Docker networks per tier)
  50: - ❌ Resource limits (CPU/memory per container)
  51: - ❌ Backup/Restore procedures
  52: - ❌ Graceful shutdown (Kafka consumers)
  53: - ❌ Log rotation & retention
  54: - ❌ CI pipeline (lint, test, build)
  55: - ❌ Horizontal scaling (multiple instances + load balancing)
  56: 
  57: ---
  58: 
  59: ## Database Strategy
  60: 
  61: ### Approach: Hybrid (1 Instance, Multiple Databases)
  62: 
  63: Không dùng shared database (tất cả dùng chung 1 DB), cũng không dùng database-per-instance (mỗi service 1 PostgreSQL riêng). Thay vào đó: **1 PostgreSQL instance, nhiều databases tách biệt theo domain**.
  64: 
  65: ```
  66: PostgreSQL instance (:5432)
  67:   ├── app_db          ← Order, Payment, Inventory, Notification (shared — cùng domain)
  68:   ├── auth_db         ← Auth Service (riêng — sensitive credentials)
  69:   └── shipping_db     ← Shipping Service + Worker (riêng — khác lifecycle)
  70: 
  71: Redis (:6379)         ← Cache (shared, tất cả services)
  72: OpenSearch (:9200)    ← Search Service (riêng)
  73: ```
  74: 
  75: ### Tại sao Hybrid?
  76: 
  77: | Quyết định | Lý do |
  78: |-----------|-------|
  79: | **app_db shared** | Order, Payment, Inventory cần JOIN bảng `orders` + `products`. Tách ra = phải sync qua event, phức tạp không cần thiết |
  80: | **auth_db riêng** | User credentials (password hash) PHẢI tách biệt — security best practice. Không service nào nên truy cập trực tiếp bảng users |
  81: | **shipping_db riêng** | Khác domain, khác lifecycle. Shipping có thể deploy/migrate schema độc lập mà không ảnh hưởng orders |
  82: | **OpenSearch riêng** | Khác engine hoàn toàn — optimized cho full-text search, không phải relational data |
  83: 
  84: ### DevOps/SRE Learning Value
  85: 
  86: | Skill | Với Hybrid approach |
  87: |-------|--------------------|
  88: | **Backup/Restore** | Backup từng database riêng: `pg_dump app_db`, `pg_dump auth_db` |
  89: | **Migration** | Migration scripts per-database, deploy độc lập |
  90: | **Connection pooling** | Mỗi service connect đúng database của mình |
  91: | **Access control** | PostgreSQL roles: `app_user` chỉ access `app_db`, `auth_user` chỉ access `auth_db` |
  92: | **Monitoring** | Per-database metrics: connections, query latency, disk usage |
  93: | **AWS mapping** | 1 RDS instance + multiple databases = cost-effective. Hoặc tách auth_db ra RDS riêng khi scale |
  94: 
  95: ### Connection Strings
  96: 
  97: ```bash
  98: # Order, Payment, Inventory, Notification Workers
  99: DATABASE_URL=postgresql://app_user:***@postgres:5432/app_db
 100: 
 101: # Auth Service
 102: AUTH_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://auth_user:***@postgres:5432/auth_db
 103: 
 104: # Shipping Service + Worker
 105: SHIPPING_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://shipping_user:***@postgres:5432/shipping_db
 106: ```
 107: 
 108: ### So sánh với các approaches khác
 109: 
 110: | Approach | Services 6 | Services 10 | Services 30+ |
 111: |----------|-----------|-------------|---------------|
 112: | Shared DB (1 DB, all tables) | ✅ Đủ | ⚠️ Bắt đầu coupling | ❌ Nightmare |
 113: | **Hybrid (1 instance, N DBs)** | ✅ | **✅ Sweet spot** | ⚠️ Cần tách instance |
 114: | DB-per-instance | ❌ Overkill | ⚠️ Tốn resource | ✅ Cần thiết |
 115: 
 116: ---
 117: 
 118: ## Đề Xuất Mở Rộng (+4 Services)
 119: 
 120: ### Tổng quan kiến trúc mới
 121: 
 122: ```
 123:                                     ┌──────────────┐
 124:                                     │ Auth Service  │ (NEW)
 125:                                     │   JWT/RBAC    │
 126:                                     │  [auth_db]    │
 127:                                     └──────┬───────┘
 128:                                            │ verify token
 129:                                            ▼
 130: Web UI → API Gateway → Order Service → Payment Service
 131:                 │             ↕                ↕
 132:                 │        [app_db]            Redis
 133:                 │             ↕
 134:                 │          Kafka
 135:                 │        ↙   ↓    ↘
 136:                 │  Notif.  Inv.   Shipping Worker (NEW)
 137:                 │  Worker  Worker     ↕
 138:                 │                 Shipping Service (NEW)
 139:                 │                     ↕
 140:                 │                [shipping_db]
 141:                 │
 142:                 └──→ Search Service (NEW)
 143:                          ↕
 144:                      OpenSearch
 145:                          ↑ sync
 146:                      [app_db] (CDC/event)
 147: ```
 148: 
 149: ---
 150: 
 151: ### Service 1: Auth Service
 152: 
 153: | Attribute | Detail |
 154: |-----------|--------|
 155: | **Port** | 5006 |
 156: | **Tech** | Python (Flask) + PyJWT |
 157: | **Database** | PostgreSQL — `auth_db` (isolated) |
 158: | **Mục đích** | Authentication + Authorization |
 159: 
 160: **Tại sao cần:**
 161: - Hiện tại KHÔNG có authentication → tất cả APIs đều public
 162: - Khi deploy AWS: cần hiểu JWT propagation qua nhiều services
 163: - Production-grade: mọi service đều cần verify token
 164: 
 165: **Chức năng:**
 166: ```
 167: POST /auth/register     → Tạo user, hash password (bcrypt)
 168: POST /auth/login        → Return JWT (access + refresh token)
 169: POST /auth/refresh      → Refresh access token
 170: GET  /auth/verify       → Verify JWT (internal, cho các services khác gọi)
 171: ```
 172: 
 173: **Patterns mới học được:**
 174: 
 175: | Pattern | Mô tả |
 176: |---------|-------|
 177: | JWT local verification | API Gateway verify JWT locally bằng public key (không cần gọi HTTP tới Auth Service). Auth down = new login fail, nhưng existing sessions vẫn hoạt động |
 178: | RBAC | User roles: `customer`, `admin`, `service` |
 179: | Token refresh | Access token 15min, refresh token 7d |
 180: | Service-to-service auth | Internal JWT với role `service` cho inter-service calls |
 181: | Key rotation | JWT signing key rotation procedure — publish new public key trước, rotate private key sau |
 182: 
 183: **Schema bổ sung:**
 184: ```sql
 185: CREATE TABLE users (
 186:     id          SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
 187:     email       VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
 188:     password    VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,  -- bcrypt hash
 189:     role        VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'customer',
 190:     is_active   BOOLEAN DEFAULT true,
 191:     created_at  TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
 192: );
 193: 
 194: CREATE TABLE refresh_tokens (
 195:     id          SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
 196:     user_id     INTEGER REFERENCES users(id),
 197:     token       VARCHAR(512) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
 198:     expires_at  TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,
 199:     revoked     BOOLEAN DEFAULT false
 200: );
 201: ```
 202: 
 203: **Impact lên services hiện tại:**
 204: - API Gateway: thêm middleware verify JWT
 205: - Order Service: extract user_id từ JWT, gắn vào order
 206: - Web UI: thêm login/register page, lưu token trong localStorage
 207: 
 208: ---
 209: 
 210: ### Service 2: Shipping Service
 211: 
 212: | Attribute | Detail |
 213: |-----------|--------|
 214: | **Port** | 5007 |
 215: | **Tech** | Python (Flask) |
 216: | **Database** | PostgreSQL — `shipping_db` (isolated) |
 217: | **Mục đích** | Quản lý shipping sau khi payment thành công |
 218: 
 219: **Tại sao cần:**
 220: - Hiện tại flow dừng ở Payment → không có gì xảy ra sau đó
 221: - Production-grade: order → payment → **shipping** → delivery
 222: - Tạo ra **Saga pattern** — distributed transaction thực tế
 223: 
 224: **Chức năng:**
 225: ```
 226: POST /shipping/create        → Tạo shipment cho order
 227: GET  /shipping/{order_id}    → Tracking status
 228: POST /shipping/{id}/cancel   → Cancel shipment (compensation)
 229: ```
 230: 
 231: **Schema bổ sung:**
 232: ```sql
 233: CREATE TABLE shipments (
 234:     id              SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
 235:     order_id        VARCHAR(50) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
 236:     status          VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'pending',
 237:     -- pending → processing → shipped → delivered → cancelled
 238:     carrier         VARCHAR(100),
 239:     tracking_number VARCHAR(100),
 240:     estimated_delivery TIMESTAMP,
 241:     shipped_at      TIMESTAMP,
 242:     delivered_at    TIMESTAMP,
 243:     created_at      TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
 244: );
 245: ```
 246: 
 247: ---
 248: 
 249: ### Service 3: Shipping Worker (Saga Orchestrator)
 250: 
 251: | Attribute | Detail |
 252: |-----------|--------|
 253: | **Port** | 5008 |
 254: | **Tech** | Python + Kafka consumer/producer |
 255: | **Mục đích** | Orchestrate Saga: payment → shipping → notification |
 256: 
 257: **Tại sao cần:**
 258: - Đây là service tạo ra **nhiều learning value nhất**
 259: - Saga pattern = distributed transaction without 2PC
 260: - Compensation logic khi bất kỳ step nào fail
 261: 
 262: **Flow:**
 263: ```
 264: Saga: Order Fulfillment
 265: 
 266: Happy path:
 267:   1. Order Service → publish order.created
 268:   2. Payment Service → process → publish order.payment_completed
 269:   3. Shipping Worker → consume → call Shipping Service → create shipment
 270:   4. Shipping Worker → publish order.shipped
 271:   5. Notification Worker → consume → notify customer "Your order has shipped"
 272: 
 273: Compensation (shipping fail):
 274:   3. Shipping Worker → consume → call Shipping Service → FAIL (out of capacity)
 275:   4. Shipping Worker → publish order.shipping_failed
 276:   5. Shipping Worker → call Payment Service → refund
 277:   6. Shipping Worker → publish order.refunded
 278:   7. Notification Worker → consume → notify customer "Refund processed"
 279: ```
 280: 
 281: **Kafka topics bổ sung:**
 282: 
 283: | Topic | Producer | Consumer |
 284: |-------|----------|----------|
 285: | `order.shipped` | Shipping Worker | Notification Worker |
 286: | `order.shipping_failed` | Shipping Worker | Notification Worker |
 287: | `order.refunded` | Shipping Worker | Notification Worker, Inventory Worker |
 288: 
 289: **Saga State Machine:**
 290: ```
 291: States: INITIATED → PAYMENT_PENDING → PAYMENT_COMPLETED → SHIPPING_PENDING
 292:         → SHIPPED | SHIPPING_FAILED → COMPENSATING → REFUNDED | COMPENSATION_FAILED
 293: 
 294: Rules:
 295:   - Timeout: 5 minutes per step, 15 minutes total saga
 296:   - Retry: 3 attempts with exponential backoff (1s, 5s, 25s)
 297:   - DLQ: after max_retries exhausted OR total timeout exceeded
 298:   - Crash recovery: on startup, query saga_state for PENDING states → resume
 299: ```
 300: 
 301: **Schema bổ sung (shipping_db):**
 302: ```sql
 303: CREATE TABLE saga_state (
 304:     saga_id     VARCHAR(50) PRIMARY KEY,
 305:     order_id    VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
 306:     state       VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
 307:     retries     INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
 308:     max_retries INTEGER DEFAULT 3,
 309:     timeout_at  TIMESTAMP,
 310:     created_at  TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW(),
 311:     updated_at  TIMESTAMP DEFAULT NOW()
 312: );
 313: ```
 314: 
 315: **Patterns mới học được:**
 316: 
 317: | Pattern | Mô tả |
 318: |---------|-------|
 319: | **Saga Orchestration** | Coordinator quản lý multi-step transaction với persistent state |
 320: | **Compensation** | Rollback khi downstream service fail |
 321: | **Dead Letter Queue** | Messages xử lý fail → DLQ topic để review |
 322: | **Retry with backoff** | Exponential backoff cho transient failures |
 323: | **Crash recovery** | Resume incomplete sagas on restart từ saga_state table |
 324: 
 325: ---
 326: 
 327: ### Service 4: Search Service
 328: 
 329: | Attribute | Detail |
 330: |-----------|--------|
 331: | **Port** | 5009 |
 332: | **Tech** | Python (Flask) + OpenSearch client |
 333: | **Database** | OpenSearch (search index) |
 334: | **Mục đích** | Full-text search cho products + orders |
 335: 
 336: **Tại sao cần:**
 337: - Học data sync giữa PostgreSQL → OpenSearch (eventual consistency)
 338: - Tạo CQRS pattern: write vào PostgreSQL, read từ OpenSearch
 339: - Trên AWS: sử dụng Amazon OpenSearch Service
 340: 
 341: **Chức năng:**
 342: ```
 343: GET  /search/products?q=laptop       → Full-text search products
 344: GET  /search/orders?q=ORD-123        → Search orders by ID/status
 345: POST /search/reindex                 → Manual reindex trigger
 346: ```
 347: 
 348: **Data sync approach (Event-driven):**
 349: ```
 350: Sync strategy:
 351:   1. Event-driven: listen order.created, order.updated → index to OpenSearch
 352:   2. Backfill: POST /search/reindex → full scan app_db → bulk index
 353:   3. Idempotency: use order_id as OpenSearch document _id (upsert, not insert)
 354:   4. Failure handling: if OpenSearch write fails → publish to search.sync.dlq
 355:   5. Index versioning: use aliases (orders_v1, orders_v2) for zero-downtime reindex
 356:   6. Lag metric: track time giữa Kafka event timestamp và OpenSearch indexed_at
 357: ```
 358: 
 359: **Patterns mới học được:**
 360: 
 361: | Pattern | Mô tả |
 362: |---------|-------|
 363: | **CQRS** | Separate read model (OpenSearch) vs write model (PostgreSQL) |
 364: | **Eventual consistency** | Search index có thể lag 1-5s sau khi write, đo bằng metric |
 365: | **Bulk indexing** | Batch sync cho reindex operations |
 366: | **Index aliasing** | Zero-downtime reindex bằng alias switching |
 367: | **Search relevance** | Scoring, boosting, fuzzy matching |
 368: 
