 600: ### Sau mở rộng (10 services)
 601: 
 602: ```
 603: Tất cả patterns cũ +
 604:   🆕 Saga Orchestration (distributed transactions + crash recovery)
 605:   🆕 Compensation (rollback when downstream fails)
 606:   🆕 Circuit Breaker (failure isolation + observability)
 607:   🆕 CQRS (read/write model separation)
