 981: | Metric | Service | Type | Ý nghĩa business |
 982: |--------|---------|------|------------------|
 983: | `revenue_dollars` | Order Service | Histogram | Revenue per hour (real-time) |
 984: | `payment_success_total{provider}` | Payment Service | Counter | Payment success by provider |
 985: | `search_to_purchase_total` | Search Service | Counter | Search queries dẫn đến purchase |
 986: | `cart_additions_total` vs `cart_checkouts_total` | API Gateway | Counter | Cart abandonment rate |
 987: 
 988: **Recording Rules:** `business:revenue_per_hour:1h`, `business:cart_abandonment_rate:1h`
