 991: | Alert | Severity | Condition | Service |
 992: |-------|----------|-----------|---------|
 993: | AuthLoginLatencyFastBurn | critical | P99 > 200ms, burn rate 14.4x (5m + 1h) | Auth |
 994: | AuthBruteForceDetected | warning | Failed logins > 10/min từ 1 IP | Auth |
