486: # Part 3: Kafka & Worker Alerts
487: 
488: ## 🔴 RB-14: KafkaExporterDown
489: **Severity:** critical | **Response:** < 15 phút
490: 
491: **Nghĩa là gì:** Không scrape được Kafka metrics. Monitoring bị mù cho event pipeline.
492: 
493: - Bước 1: `docker ps | grep kafka-exporter`
494: - Bước 2: `docker logs kafka-exporter --tail 20`
495: - Bước 3: `docker restart kafka-exporter`
496: - Bước 4: Nếu vẫn fail → kiểm tra Kafka broker: `docker logs kafka --tail 20`
497: 
498: **Escalation:** Xem [Escalation Matrix](#escalation-matrix). Kafka exporter down = monitoring blind cho event pipeline. Chưa resolve sau 15 phút → Team Lead.
499: 
500: ## 🟡 RB-15: KafkaTopicUnderReplicated
501: **Severity:** warning
502: 
503: **Nghĩa là gì:** Partition không có đủ replicas. Data durability at risk.
504: 
505: **Bước 1: Xác định topic/partition**
506: - Alert annotation chứa `{{ topic }}` và `{{ partition }}`
507: 
508: **Bước 2: Check Kafka broker health**
509: ```bash
510: docker exec kafka kafka-topics.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --describe --topic <topic>
511: ```
512: 
513: **Bước 3: Nếu single-node (lab environment)**
514: - Replication factor = 1 → alert này expected
515: - Có thể suppress nếu không relevant
516: 
517: ## 🟡 RB-16: KafkaConsumerLagHigh (lag > 100)
518: **Severity:** warning | **Response:** < 4 giờ
519: 
520: **Bước 1: Xác định consumer group**
521: - Kafka Overview dashboard → Consumer Lag panel
522: - Group nào lag: notification-workers? inventory-workers?
523: 
524: **Bước 2: Check worker health**
525: ```bash
526: docker ps | grep <worker-name>
527: docker logs <worker-name> --tail 20
528: ```
529: 
530: **Bước 3: Phân loại**
531: - Worker running, lag tăng chậm → processing chậm → check downstream (DB, external API)
532: - Worker running, lag tăng nhanh → produce rate > consume rate → cần scale workers
533: - Worker restarting → check OOM, error logs
534: 
535: ## 🔴 RB-17: KafkaConsumerLagCritical (lag > 1000)
536: **Severity:** critical | **Response:** < 15 phút
537: 
538: **Triage:** Tương tự RB-16 nhưng khẩn cấp — backlog rất lớn.
539: 
540: > ⚠️ **Lag > 1000 = hàng nghìn events chưa xử lý**
541: > - Notifications bị delay
542: > - Inventory updates bị delay
543: > - Business impact: customers không nhận được confirmation
544: 
545: **Quick fix:** `docker restart <worker-name>`
546: 
547: Nếu vẫn lag → check produce rate trên Kafka Overview
548: - Nếu produce rate cũng cao → traffic spike, cần scale
549: 
550: **Escalation:** Xem [Escalation Matrix](#escalation-matrix). Lag > 1000 kéo dài > 15 phút → Team Lead. Lag vẫn tăng sau restart → Engineering Manager.
551: 
552: ## 🔴 RB-18: KafkaConsumerGroupDown
553: **Severity:** critical | **Response:** < 15 phút
554: 
555: **Bước 1: Xác định group**
556: - Alert: `{{ consumergroup }}`
557: 
558: **Bước 2: Check worker container**
559: ```bash
560: docker ps -a | grep <worker>
561: # Nếu Exited → docker start <worker>
562: # Nếu Running → docker restart <worker>
563: ```
564: 
565: **Bước 3: Verify**
566: - Kafka Overview → consumer group members > 0
567: - Consumer lag bắt đầu giảm (catch-up)
568: 
569: **Escalation:** Xem [Escalation Matrix](#escalation-matrix). Consumer group down > 15 phút → Team Lead.
570: 
571: ## 🟡 RB-19/20: Worker High Error Rate
572: **Severity:** warning | **Applies to:** notification-worker, inventory-worker
573: 
574: **Bước 1: Check error logs**
575: ```bash
576: docker logs <worker-name> --tail 50 | grep -i error
577: ```
578: 
579: **Bước 2: Common causes**
580: - DB connection failed → check postgres container
581: - Kafka deserialization error → check message format
582: - Downstream service timeout → check dependency health
583: 
584: **Bước 3: Fix**
585: - Transient error → `docker restart <worker>`
586: - Persistent error → check code/config, tạo ticket
