590: # Part 4: Application Alerts (Tracing-based)
591: 
592: ## 🟡 RB-21: HighErrorRate
593: **Severity:** warning | **Source:** Span metrics
594: 
595: **Nghĩa là gì:** Service có > 10% requests trả về error (từ distributed tracing data).
596: 
597: **Bước 1: Xác định service**
598: - Alert: `{{ service_name }}`
599: 
600: **Bước 2: Drill down**
601: - App Performance → service section → error rate panel
602: - Tracing → filter service + status=error → xem error message
603: - Docker Logs → filter container → tìm stack trace
604: 
605: **Bước 3: So sánh với SLO alerts**
606: - HighErrorRate firing + Burn Rate alert **KHÔNG** firing
607:   - Error rate cao nhưng chưa đủ để ảnh hưởng SLO budget
608:   - Tạo ticket, fix trong sprint
609: - HighErrorRate firing + Burn Rate alert **CÙNG** firing
610:   - Nghiêm trọng → follow RB-08/10/12
611: 
612: ## 🟡 RB-22: HighLatencyP95
613: **Severity:** warning | **Source:** Span metrics
614: 
615: **Bước 1: Xác định service**
616: - Alert: `{{ service_name }}`
617: - App Performance → P95 duration panel
618: 
619: **Bước 2: Tìm bottleneck qua Tracing**
620: - Sort traces by duration (longest first)
621: - Xem span nào chậm nhất:
622:   - `db.query` span chậm → DB issue
623:   - `http.request` span chậm → downstream service issue
624:   - `processing` span chậm → CPU/memory issue
625: 
626: **Bước 3: Cross-reference**
627: - Docker Containers → CPU/Memory cho container đó
628: - Nếu CPU > 80% → resource contention (xem RB-02)
629: 
630: ## 🔴 RB-23: ServiceNoTraces_*
631: **Severity:** critical | **Condition:** Chỉ fire khi traffic-gen đang chạy
632: 
633: **Bước 1: Confirm traffic-gen đang chạy**
634: ```bash
635: docker ps | grep traffic-gen
636: ```
637: 
638: **Bước 2: Check service container**
639: ```bash
640: docker ps | grep <service-name>
641: docker logs <service-name> --tail 20
642: ```
643: 
644: **Bước 3: Nếu container running nhưng không có traces**
645: - OTel SDK issue → check OTel Collector logs
646: - Network issue → container có reach được otel-collector không?
647: ```bash
648: docker exec <service> wget -q -O- http://otel-collector:4318/v1/traces
649: ```
650: 
651: ## 🔴 RB-24: ServiceHealthCheckFailed
652: **Severity:** critical | **Response:** < 15 phút
653: 
654: **Nghĩa là gì:** Blackbox Exporter probe `/health/live` thất bại. Service không phản hồi hoặc không trả HTTP 200. Đây là active probing → detect service down mà không phụ thuộc vào traffic.
655: 
656: **Triage:**
657: 
658: **Bước 1: Xác định service nào bị**
659: - Alert annotation: instance = URL bị fail (ví dụ: `http://192.168.100.57:5001/health/live`)
660: - Map port → service:
661:   - 5000 = api-gateway
662:   - 5001 = order-service
663:   - 5002 = payment-service
664:   - 5004 = notification-worker
665:   - 5005 = inventory-worker
666: 
667: **Bước 2: Kiểm tra container**
668: ```bash
669: ssh 192.168.100.57
670: docker ps -a | grep <service-name>
671: docker logs <service-name> --tail 30
672: ```
673: 
674: **Bước 3: Phân loại**
675: - Container Exited → `docker start <service-name>`
676: - Container Running → Port có listen không? `curl localhost:<port>/health/live`
677: - Container OOMKilled → Kiểm tra HighMemoryUsage alert, tăng memory limit
678: - Network unreachable → Kiểm tra firewall / docker network
679: 
680: **Bước 4: Verify recovery**
681: - Chờ 1-2 phút, kiểm tra Prometheus targets → blackbox job healthy
682: - Alerting Overview → alert chuyển RESOLVED
683: - Unified Overview → RPS hồi phục (nếu có traffic)
684: 
685: **Dashboard path:** Alerting Overview → Docker Containers (restart count) → Unified Overview
686: 
687: **Phân biệt với:**
688: - `TargetDown` → Prometheus scrape target down (OTel Collector, node-exporter...)
689: - `ServiceHealthCheckFailed` → Application service health endpoint down
690: - `ServiceNoTraces` → Service chạy nhưng không produce traces (cần traffic-gen)
691: 
692: **Escalation:** Xem [Escalation Matrix](#escalation-matrix). Service health check failed > 15 phút → Team Lead.
693: 
